{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Slippers</strong> is a desktop idle game that lives in a corner of your screen. Inside it, a pair of slippers roams around, chasing down bugs and earning you a steady stream of rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t control the action, you simply watch it unfold. Upgrade your slippers, and enjoy the oddly satisfying bug chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be watched while you work or relax, Desktop Slippers brings that same quiet, rhythmic charm as the background clips you can\u2019t help but glance at, a tiny living desktop distraction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Idle gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your slippers do all the work. You just watch, upgrade, and enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154390/extras/3a88f8c6f5f46dbae3879b1906839717.poster.avif?t=1774089127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154390/extras/3a88f8c6f5f46dbae3879b1906839717.webm?t=1774089127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154390/extras/3a88f8c6f5f46dbae3879b1906839717.mp4?t=1774089127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lives on your desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A small, movable window that fits neatly in a corner of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154390/extras/b4f39230bb7b5429572c3e87e8cd9d2f.poster.avif?t=1774089127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154390/extras/b4f39230bb7b5429572c3e87e8cd9d2f.webm?t=1774089127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154390/extras/b4f39230bb7b5429572c3e87e8cd9d2f.mp4?t=1774089127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Upgrade system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spend your earnings to improve slipper speed, maneuverability, and other perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154390/extras/7237131b29761a61930ae0c55d33c3bd.poster.avif?t=1774089127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154390/extras/7237131b29761a61930ae0c55d33c3bd.webm?t=1774089127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154390/extras/7237131b29761a61930ae0c55d33c3bd.mp4?t=1774089127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4154390?t=1774089127","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4154390?t=1774089127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154390/86acdcddcc42794681e25dcaa676186ec5b491aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774089127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154390/86acdcddcc42794681e25dcaa676186ec5b491aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774089127","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[